                                "sense_id": "6df97967-ab2e-3988-9182-b66bd251b64f",
                                "text": "Stepping right into a trap... Your biggest problem is that you got big cojones but nothing in your brains.\nI think Freud would have something to say about your obsession with my big cojones."
                            },
